{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce It</strong> is a fast-paced arcade game built around one core rule:<br><strong>Keep the ball bouncing from side to side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each bounce keeps you in the game. Time your inputs well to maintain the rhythm and stay on track. Across every game mode, the challenge is to keep the motion going while adapting to new patterns, obstacles, and setups. Score higher, survive longer, and unlock new content as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn experience by completing levels and improving your score. As you level up, you\u2019ll unlock new game modes and skin tokens to get skins and visual effects to personalize your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Signature Bounce Mechanic</strong><br>A satisfying side-to-side bounce that defines every mode and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong><br>Unlock new variations of the core mechanic, each offering unique pacing and twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression Through Play</strong><br>Gain experience by clearing levels, reaching milestones, and improving your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Skins</strong><br>Customize your ball, bouncer, particles, trail and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level Challenges and Endless Score Runs</strong><br>Play through handcrafted stages or push your skills to the limit in endless modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist Visuals with Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Clean, readable presentation designed to keep you immersed and in control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce It </strong>is my first solo commercial project. It is a compact arcade game focused on the challenge of staying alive by bouncing. The game has been refined through feedback, and I will keep supporting it based on what players enjoy most.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482000?t=1747951842","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482000?t=1747951842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482000/16c96b5b4389ba6246646e0e065451f0441a8739/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747951842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482000/16c96b5b4389ba6246646e0e065451f0441a8739/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747951842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce It</strong> is a fast-paced arcade game built around one core rule:<br><strong>Keep the ball bouncing from side to side.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each bounce keeps you in the game. Time your inputs well to maintain the rhythm and stay on track. Across every game mode, the challenge is to keep the motion going while adapting to new patterns, obstacles, and setups. Score higher, survive longer, and unlock new content as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn experience by completing levels and improving your score. As you level up, you\u2019ll unlock new game modes and skin tokens to get skins and visual effects to personalize your experience.</